                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/362.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé MacMurray to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-10-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 20,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Siamese Government accepts invitation to participate Shanghai opium
                    conference.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
